LakeOfRage_Text_Gyarados::
    .string "The RED GYARADOS is enraged!\n"
    .string "A radio signal echoes nearby.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_GyaradosClear::
    .string "The lake grows quiet for now.\n"
    .string "LANCE waits on the south bank.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_LanceBefore::
    .string "LANCE: I recognize your KANTO\n"
    .string "partner. Help that GYARADOS.\p"
    .string "This is forced evolution.\n"
    .string "I will trace the radio signal.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_LanceJoined::
    .string "LANCE: I found a ROCKET base\n"
    .string "under MAHOGANY's souvenir shop.\p"
    .string "Their KANTO operation failed.\n"
    .string "Now they are forcing evolution.\p"
    .string "Meet me inside the shop.\n"
    .string "We will stop their transmitter.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_LanceFull::
    .string "Keep this RED SCALE as evidence.\n"
    .string "Make room and speak to me again.\p"
    .string "Our investigation can continue.\n"
    .string "Meet me at MAHOGANY's shop.$"

LakeOfRage_Text_LanceAfter::
    .string "LANCE: The transmitter is quiet.\n"
    .string "You saved the lake's POKEMON.\p"
    .string "I will warn the RADIO TOWER.\n"
    .string "ROCKET may try one last plan.$"

